From 8a030bafe69969cc686459c9f64d48125935cdde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 11:17:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Static Site form fixes: inline checkbox encode list, fix
 squished spacing

- Encode is now an inline row of checkboxes (form-check-inline) instead
  of a <select multiple> -- clearer at a glance, no ctrl/cmd-click
  discoverability problem, and consistent with every other checkbox in
  the app. No backend change needed: form.getlist("encode") reads
  multiple same-named checkboxes exactly the same way it read multiple
  selected <option>s.
- Fixed the squished spacing above the Directory browsing toggle in
  Advanced options: the trailing "remove bottom margin in edit mode"
  class (mb-md-0) had been left on the Index files field, a leftover
  from the pattern this was adapted from (where the field it was copied
  from genuinely was the last one in the accordion). Since Index files
  isn't the last field here, that removed its spacing before Browse
  instead. Moved it to Browse, which -- in edit mode, where there's no
  Create disabled checkbox after it -- actually is the last field.

Verified: confirmed the encode checkboxes submit/round-trip correctly
(create with multiple checked, edit page reflects the right ones
checked) and produce identical rendered .conf output as before; confirmed
Index files now has normal spacing before Browse in both new and edit
mode, and that Browse still sits flush with the accordion bottom in edit
mode as originally intended. Full create/edit/preview regression across
all five block types still passes, and pyflakes is clean.
---
 templates/block_form.html | 15 +++++++++------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/templates/block_form.html b/templates/block_form.html
index 751fec5..84e7cf1 100644
--- a/templates/block_form.html
+++ b/templates/block_form.html
@@ -278,12 +278,15 @@
             <div class="invalid-feedback">File path is required.</div>
           </div>
           <div class="mb-3">
-            <label class="form-label">Encode <span class="form-hint d-inline">(optional, ctrl/cmd-click to select more than one)</span></label>
-            <select name="encode" class="form-select" multiple size="3">
+            <label class="form-label">Encode <span class="form-hint d-inline">(optional)</span></label>
+            <div>
               {% for fmt in ['gzip', 'zstd', 'br'] %}
-              <option value="{{ fmt }}" {{ 'selected' if fmt in (meta.encode or []) }}>{{ fmt }}</option>
+              <label class="form-check form-check-inline">
+                <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" name="encode" value="{{ fmt }}" {{ 'checked' if fmt in (meta.encode or []) }}>
+                <span class="form-check-label">{{ fmt }}</span>
+              </label>
               {% endfor %}
-            </select>
+            </div>
           </div>
           <!-- BEGIN ADVANCED OPTIONS -->
           <div class="accordion mb-3" id="advanced-options">
@@ -303,11 +306,11 @@
                     <label class="form-label">Hide <span class="form-hint d-inline">(optional, space-separated glob patterns kept out of listings and direct requests)</span></label>
                     <input type="text" name="hide" class="form-control" value="{{ meta.hide or '' }}" placeholder=".git .env">
                   </div>
-                  <div class="mb-3 {{ 'mb-md-0' if mode != 'new' }}">
+                  <div class="mb-3">
                     <label class="form-label">Index files <span class="form-hint d-inline">(optional, space-separated — defaults to index.html/index.txt)</span></label>
                     <input type="text" name="index" class="form-control" value="{{ meta.index or '' }}" placeholder="index.html index.htm">
                   </div>
-                  <div class="mb-3">
+                  <div class="mb-3 {{ 'mb-md-0' if mode != 'new' }}">
                     <label class="form-check">
                       <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" name="browse" value="1" {{ 'checked' if meta.browse }}>
                       <span class="form-check-label">Directory browsing</span>
-- 
